    "name": "Lost Luminosity",
    "steam_appid": 3603100,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603100/extras/7b0f379ba948f9f21482bd468e830086.avif?t=1754128362\" width=700 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Luminosity is a first-person psychological horror game with a linear storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Brief Story</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will take on the role of Sam, whose mother passed away shortly after being released from a psychiatric hospital. He still doesn't know why she began to lose her mind, which led to her mental disorders, or who is behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Gameplay</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay will involve exploring an apartment where you can uncover the true events of the past, unravel your father's fate, and understand the reasons behind your mother's psychological disorders. The game also addresses relevant social issues related to society and family, offering a perspective on your character from the outside. You will experience the presence of supernatural forces. Will you be able to confront them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Game Features</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive and disturbing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep storyline with horror elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compelling experience with fear</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603100/extras/7b0f379ba948f9f21482bd468e830086.avif?t=1754128362\" width=700 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Luminosity is a first-person psychological horror game with a linear storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Brief Story</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will take on the role of Sam, whose mother passed away shortly after being released from a psychiatric hospital. He still doesn't know why she began to lose her mind, which led to her mental disorders, or who is behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Gameplay</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay will involve exploring an apartment where you can uncover the true events of the past, unravel your father's fate, and understand the reasons behind your mother's psychological disorders. The game also addresses relevant social issues related to society and family, offering a perspective on your character from the outside. You will experience the presence of supernatural forces. Will you be able to confront them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Game Features</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive and disturbing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep storyline with horror elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compelling experience with fear</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The inheritance following his mother\u2019s death turns into a series of mysterious events for Sam. Neighbors are complaining about strange noises and unexplained phenomena in the empty apartment. Intrigued, he decides to investigate what\u2019s going on there himself.",
